help us make the system safer.

5253
06:40:54.080 --> 06:40:58.080
In May, the RSA published an interactive
map of road traffic injury collisions

5254
06:40:58.080 --> 06:41:03.480
covering fatal, serious and minor injury
collisions between 2016 and 2024.

5255
06:41:03.800 --> 06:41:08.260
This is a really useful step towards
transparency and evidence-based decision

5256
06:41:08.260 --> 06:41:08.740
making.

5257
06:41:08.740 --> 06:41:11.780
However, that information has to lead to
action.

5258
06:41:12.320 --> 06:41:16.640
We need local authorities to have the
power, the resources and the obligation to

5259
06:41:16.640 --> 06:41:19.140
act when the evidence tells us that a road
is dangerous.

5260
06:41:19.680 --> 06:41:22.010
brings me to the wider context of this
Bill.

5261
06:41:22.500 --> 06:41:25.480
Road traffic legislation is not merely an
administrative exercise.

5262
06:41:26.260 --> 06:41:29.160
Ireland is in the middle of a road safety
crisis and I do not think any of us are

5263
06:41:29.160 --> 06:41:31.500
