Road design should also form part of the
overall enforcement strategy from a

5445
06:51:41.080 --> 06:51:43.000
proactive preventative perspective.

5446
06:51:43.460 --> 06:51:47.260
I hope that the data-sharing element of
this Bill will have a positive impact in

5447
06:51:47.260 --> 06:51:47.700
that regard.

5448
06:51:48.120 --> 06:51:51.540
We need to redesign the dangerous
locations identified through collision

5449
06:51:51.540 --> 06:51:56.320
data and crucially we need to give local
