We cannot look at these figures and
conclude that the current approach is

5455
06:52:16.920 --> 06:52:18.630
working; much more needs to be done.

5456
06:52:19.380 --> 06:52:24.720
I want to briefly touch on the RSA given
its role as a competent authority when it

5457
06:52:24.720 --> 06:52:25.400
