decisions on road safety.

5473
06:53:18.720 --> 06:53:23.960
Whatever model it takes we need a much
more active authority in the road safety

5474
06:53:23.960 --> 06:53:24.340
space.

5475
06:53:25.700 --> 06:53:30.560
South Dublin County Council recently ran a
consultation on proposals to install large

5476
06:53:30.560 --> 06:53:33.430
